<b>Progress-bars

There are 2 Progress-bars.
The one on the left side shows timing infos for the playing Audiofile.
The other one shows timing infos for the playing List.

Each Progress-bar has 4 values:

2:14 / 5:09  -> time / duration
(43%)        ->  percentage
-2:55        ->  remaining time

In the Colors window it is possible to modify the colors for the Progress-bars.
